{"id":"b2aa62f1a3d9ec85","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-equationalclosurechar.md","title":"Equational characterization and variable closure","display":"thm-equationalclosurechar — Equational characterization and variable closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-equationalclosurechar","aliases":["27-thm-equationalclosurechar"],"display":"thm-equationalclosurechar — Equational characterization and variable closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-variableidentification]]","[[27-df-equationalclass]]","[[27-df-functionalequation]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§11.4 Theorems 11.7, 11.9, and 11.11","source_printed_pages":"496–500","source_pdf_pages":"520–524","verification_status":"source-statements-and-proof-checked-positive-arities","local_review_status":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-equationalclosurechar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-equationalclosurechar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-equationalclosurechar — Equational characterization and variable closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7b29c798e40853c1\" href=\"?note=7b29c798e40853c1\" title=\"27-df-variableidentification\">27-df-variableidentification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6afd580565e13acf\" href=\"?note=6afd580565e13acf\" title=\"27-df-equationalclass\">27-df-equationalclass</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§11.4 Theorems 11.7, 11.9, and 11.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"496–500"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"520–524"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statements-and-proof-checked-positive-arities"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formalization-audited-from-supplied-text; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+\">\\(K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqDef}_+\">\\(\\mathrm{EqDef}_+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+\">\\(\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Id}_r\">\\(\\mathrm{Id}_r\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7b29c798e40853c1\" href=\"?note=7b29c798e40853c1\" title=\"27-df-variableidentification\">27-df-variableidentification</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_n\">\\(\\models_n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\">\\(\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"599d9af24f7e091a\" href=\"?note=599d9af24f7e091a\" title=\"27-df-functionalequation\">27-df-functionalequation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6ea7333297b3209a\" href=\"?note=6ea7333297b3209a\" title=\"27-df-vectorinterpretation\">27-df-vectorinterpretation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqDef}_+(K)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EqDef}_+(K)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Theorems 11.7、11.9、11.11，印刷 pp.496–500／PDF pp.520–524；已逐项读完证明，特别核对 q=0 分支和式 (11.11) 的补号（PDF p.522 图像）。限定正元数，避免零元类边界反例。</p>\n<p>必要性：若 g=Idᵣ(f)，逐坐标操作与 Δᵣ 交换，因此方程对 g 的每次输入求值等于对 f 在复制后的向量赋值上求值。若 g=Padₙ,ₖ(f)，将全部向量投影至前 n 坐标也与逐坐标操作交换。因此一个方程的模型类对两种操作闭合；任意模型类交仍闭合。</p>\n<p>充分性采用原书分离方程构造。对每个 g∉K、g:Bᵐ→B，m≥1，把 Bᵐ 全部 t=2ᵐ 个向量作为矩阵 A 的行。对 i∈[t]、b∈B，定义 t 元布尔函数 h_b,i：输入列属于 A 的列集时返回第 i 个坐标，其余列返回 b。各 h 有有限布尔表达式。以这些表达式的向量解释为输入，令方程要求“至少一项 f(h_b,i) 与 g(A_i) 不同”；具体是所有 g(A_i)=0 对应 f(h_b,i) 的析取，与所有 g(A_i)=1 对应 f(h_b,i) 的合取之补的析取，等于 1。空析取、合取取 0、1，可由常元叶子表示；外层至少保留一个形式调用而忽略其值，符合 s,t≥1。</p>\n<p>g 在 A 的行赋值处逐项匹配自身，故违反此分离方程。若任意正元数 f 在 W 的行赋值处也违反，所有相应值等于 g(A_i)。W 与 A 有 q&gt;0 种共同列时，把共同列各取一个代表，将其余列并到第一个代表；随后添加无关变量并置换，得到 g。对应每个行，非共同列被 h_0,i 或 h_1,i 统一填成所选代表的该行值，所以这个识别确实保留所需输出。q=0 时，h_0,i 和 h_1,i 分别给全0和全1，所有 g(A_i)=f(0ⁿ)=f(1ⁿ)；将 f 的全部变量识别成一个变量即得该常函数，再添加 m−1 个无关变量得到 g。闭包于是推出 f∉K。全部 g∉K 的分离方程同时恰好刻画 K；FEq 可编码这些有限表达式，故所需集合存在。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-variableidentification","status":"resolved","id":"7b29c798e40853c1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-variableidentification]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-equationalclass","status":"resolved","id":"6afd580565e13acf","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-equationalclass]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-functionalequation]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-variableidentification","status":"resolved","id":"7b29c798e40853c1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-functionalequation","status":"resolved","id":"599d9af24f7e091a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-vectorinterpretation","status":"resolved","id":"6ea7333297b3209a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+$；$\\mathrm{EqDef}_+$、$\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+$、$\\mathrm{Id}_r$、$\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}$ 见 [[27-df-variableidentification]]；$\\models_n$、$\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}$ 分别见 [[27-df-functionalequation]]、[[27-df-vectorinterpretation]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K\\subseteq\\mathcal U_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqDef}_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Id}_r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Pad}_{n,k}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lift}_{m,n}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EqDef}_+(K)\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{MinorClosed}_+(K).","display":true}],"bytes":3329,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-equationalclosurechar|thm-equationalclosurechar — Equational characterization and variable closure]]"},{"id":"7ef17f865bf13a3e","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5810614a217ff037","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["7b29c798e40853c1","6afd580565e13acf","599d9af24f7e091a","6ea7333297b3209a"]}